# Phase 1 (this deployment) needs NO environment variables — everything is
# mock data held in React state. Do not add secrets here.

# Phase 2 will add a backend/API. Any value the browser needs must be prefixed
# with VITE_ (Vite exposes these at BUILD time, so they are public by design).
# Example:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api.example.com

# Secrets (database URLs, service tokens, API keys) belong in Vercel
# serverless functions under /api, configured in the Vercel dashboard —
# never in a VITE_ variable or in this repository.
